### snapshot
GET /api/directory/snapshot
200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2,"spaces":[{"id":"{space}","name":"Golden","members":[{"sub":"{user}","email":"golden@facile.studio","name":"Golden Person","picture":"{issuer}/avatars/{user}","role":"owner"}]}]}


### snapshot without credentials
GET /api/directory/snapshot
401 Unauthorized
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
Www-Authenticate: Basic realm="registre directory"

{"error":"unauthorized"}


### deletions
GET /api/directory/deletions?since=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"deleted":[{"sub":"erased-one","deleted_at":"2026-11-01T13:00:00.123456+01:00"},{"sub":"erased-two","deleted_at":"2026-11-01T13:00:00.123456+01:00"}]}


### deletions after the last
GET /api/directory/deletions?since=2026-11-02T00:00:00Z
200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"deleted":[]}


### deletions bad since
GET /api/directory/deletions?since=yesterday
400 Bad Request
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"error":"since must be RFC 3339"}


### deletions bad cursor
GET /api/directory/deletions?cursor=%%%
200 OK
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json

{"deleted":[{"sub":"erased-one","deleted_at":"2026-11-01T13:00:00.123456+01:00"},{"sub":"erased-two","deleted_at":"2026-11-01T13:00:00.123456+01:00"}]}


### deletions without credentials
GET /api/directory/deletions
401 Unauthorized
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
Www-Authenticate: Basic realm="registre directory"

{"error":"unauthorized"}


